antastical,"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "I know that laughter\u2019s our sweetest music,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "And in Switzerland, fun\u2019s always fantastic."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}